  "prefLabel": "Ins 901.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 901.01 Scope. The provisions of this part shall apply to all reports, statements, and other documents filed with or provided to the insurance department or issued to the public in connection with the business of insurance.\n\nSource. #1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5649, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7028, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRES: 10-29-99; ss by #7123, eff 10-29-99; ss by #8965, eff 9-1-07; ss by #10919, eff 9-1-15; ss by #14511, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
